                        <locus target="#148v">-148v</locus>كل صيحة عليهم هم العدو فاحذرهم قاتلهم الله اني يوفكون</explicit>
                     <note>Fragments of al-Qur’ān bound in mixed up order. Some folios upside down. Major part of the text is from the second half of al-Qur’ān but on fols 129v-140r the text is from sūra 2. Fol. 132v is blank except for owner's marks. Different hands. Words divided into two lines. Vocalized.</note>
